#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0648 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "Authority: SDTM and SDTMIG Conformance Rules v2.0 CG0648 (Rule: TP dataset not present). The rule is anchored on the TP dataset itself (Scope.Domains [TP]), so a study without TP never evaluates it: there is no executable noViolation case. On the DM dataset of a study with no TP the rule is not evaluated."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
S1 | DM | S1-001
